\par\vspace{.3em}\noindent\textbf{Use of AI.} The analysis code, the figures and the first draft of this text were produced with Claude (Anthropic) under the authors' direction, and the system's code was written with AI coding assistants. Every number is computed from the stored record by the code in the repository. References were checked against Crossref or the source's own page; for some, only the bibliographic record could be verified. An independent automated review found errors in the first version, which were corrected. The authors are responsible for the content.
